  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="73">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 73</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="73" corresp="#wit-g-a">⁊ sitte ælc wuduwe werleas XII monað, ceose syððan þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> heo sylf wylle.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="73" corresp="#wit-a">And sitte ælc wuduwe werleas twelf monað, ceose siððan þæt hio silf wille.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="73" corresp="#wit-q">Et sit omnis uidua sine marito XII mensibus; eligat postea, quem uelit.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="73" corresp="#wit-b">Be wydewan, þæt heo sitte XII monðas ceorlæs. And sitte ælc wuduwe werleas twelf monað ⁊ ceose heo syððan þæt heo sylf wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Concerning widows, that they remain for a year without a husband. And every widow shall remain twelve months without a husband, and she shall afterwards choose what she herself desires.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">(Von der Wittwe, dass sie zwölf Monate gattenlos sitze. B) Und jede Wittwe sitze gattenlos zwölf Monate lang, (und B) wähle sie nachher, was sie selbst will.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">(Of the widow, that she should remain twelve months without a husband. B) And let every widow remain without a husband for twelve months; (and, B) afterwards let her choose what she herself wishes.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares VI Atr 26.1.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
